    73	## Metrics
    74	- PRIMARY: count of stock resolved=True / 33, Wilson 95% CI. No override of the stock verdict by setup flags: H rows are
    75	  resolved=False in the stock verdict and count as FAIL in the primary. Sensitivity line: pass rate over the non-H rows (n stated).
    76	  KNOWN-DIAG count listed.
    77	- Per repo (rich 27, fastapi 6), descriptive. Note: dev includes the 8 plan-005/006 screen ids (tuned-on); report pass rate on the 25
    78	  never-screened ids separately as a descriptive line.
