    80	  files, agent wall p50/p90, verification wall p50/p90, LLM calls/tool calls per task.
    81	- Dec 060 Addendum metric (all arms): identical consecutive tool-call runs (same tool + byte-identical args): per-task max run,
    82	  tasks with run >= 3 and >= 5, total repeated calls (code: eval/plan005_armF_compare.py logic).
    83	- Dec 062 item 5: thinking blocks per task (count + total chars; eval/thinking_bound.py logic), descriptive; with thinking_budget 0
    84	  one 17-char block was seen in arm F.
